---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { pageTitle } from '../data/site';

// No pageDates entry and no dateline: a 404 has nothing meaningful to date.
// @astrojs/sitemap leaves 404 out on its own, and the referral filter in
// astro.config.mjs excludes it belt-and-braces.
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle('Page Not Found')}
  description="That page isn't here — probed and came up empty. Start with the quick-start field process, the trap picks, or the full list of gopher control methods."
  noindex
>
  <header>
    <h1>Nothing in This Hole</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Probed, came up empty. That page either moved or never existed — either way, there's no gopher
      down there.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Try one of these instead</h2>
      <ul class="fourohfour-links">
        <li>
          <a href="/quick-start/">The Taco Method: start here</a> — the field process start to
          finish: find the fresh mound, probe for the main run, set, confirm.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/best-gopher-traps/">The traps I actually set</a> — the short list, with what each
          one is good at and where it gives you trouble.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/methods/">All 13 gopher control methods</a> — compared on speed, cost and
          difficulty, with the ones I haven't used myself flagged.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/">Back to the homepage</a> — if you'd rather just start over.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="fourohfour-note">
        If you got here from a link on this site, that's my mistake — email
        <strong>hello@howtokillgophers.com</strong> and I'll fix it.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .fourohfour-links {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .fourohfour-links li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .fourohfour-note {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }
</style>
